WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:04.490
Good morning.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.160
You didn't oversleep this time.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.250
Of course not! Today's special after all!

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.120
It's finally here.

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:21.960
Yeah... We're at the finals at last.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:35.430
Final battle! Aiming for the Top of Asia!

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:39.120
Whatever happens, today is our last fight.

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:42.080
To fight in the first round will be... Max.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:43.350
<i>Yay!</i>

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.610
Rei will go second, and Takao will go third.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.540
Okay.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.110
Leave it to me!

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.190
Is this setup okay with you, Kai?

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:57.490
Do what you want.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:03.490
We'll be leaving, then. Let's go to the stadium of our final battle.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:04.510
Yeah!

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:20.290
Today is the day we settle
everything. You understand, right?

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:20.760
Tsk!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.760
I'm not okay with this, at all.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:24.590
Kiki.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:27.350
Why the heck can't I participate?!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.740
You are the weakest among the four of us.

00:03:29.740 --> 00:03:32.300
This is why you can't participate today.

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:38.130
Today's match is one we absolutely cannot afford to lose.

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:47.600
As you already know, the Chinese team we're facing off against today is awfully strong.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:52.300
They're a powerful opponent, way beyond the ones we've met until now.

00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:58.500
According to my analysis, their combined destructive power is <i>five times</i> that of the BBA team.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.080
Five times? <i>Wow!</i> That's a lot...

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:05.940
This is getting fun! The stronger the opponent is, the more excited I get!

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:14.110
Their offensive power is definitely below ours. But that's no reason to let down your guard.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:17.110
Like they say, 'despair turns cowards courageous'.

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:20.660
That's why we must fight this
battle with our strongest lineup.

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:26.080
Bring it on! I'll use 120% of my power and take them down!

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.930
Yes. Just what I wanted to hear.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:36.040
<i>Yes!</i> I fully agree. If we don't win this match, we won't be able to advance to the next world tournament.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:37.700
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.830
And then...

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.430
And then there's the Rei issue....

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:47.380
Rei...

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.310
We will defeat the traitor,

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:54.570
and take Byakko's Bit back with us. That is our important mission.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.640
And today we will carry it out.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:04.580
We have to end everything today, so that the Byakko Clan will stop going after Rei.

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:10.250
And to do that, we must...

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:12.170
face the Chinese team...

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.340
face the BBA team...

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.250
and win!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.710
Come on, let's go.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:58.000
The time is finally here.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:03.800
After making it all the way here, I have nothing left to say to you. Do your best.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.810
Thanks! Well, you can relax. We've got this in the bucket.

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:10.110
Did you mean 'in the bag'?

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:12.130
O-Oh, yeah...

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:18.180
If you're so full of spirit, I'm sure a bucket will do just fine.

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:19.480
Uh, Rei-kun.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:20.800
Yes?

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:28.960
I know you went through a lot here, but please show me a good match. I expect great things from you.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:30.380
I will.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:36.210
By the way, Max-kun will be fighting the first round, right?

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.960
Yeah, he's having a briefing with the Professor.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:47.210
Your opponent is be Gaou.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.010
He uses a Bey with the Sacred Beast of a bear.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:57.610
In the prevous battles, he showed a tremendous amount of power.

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:58.570
Nonetheless...

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:09.860
Looking at his fight against the Mongolian team, he's not using that power at its fullest.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:30.370
Don't underestimate Gaou's dormant power, but I think you have a shot at defeating him.

00:07:30.710 --> 00:07:36.890
All you have to do is bring out the full potential of this new Draciel...

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.620
and put up a good fight.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.220
I get the message.

00:07:43.220 --> 00:07:44.410
That won't do!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.220
W-What is it?

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:49.580
'A good fight' is not enough! You have to put up a fight so good that you're sure to win!

00:07:52.060 --> 00:07:53.410
Professor...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:59.440
After Gaou, we'll be up against Mao and Lai, two incredibly tough opponents!

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:03.760
We still have no idea how effective Takao and Rei's abilities will be against them.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:08.090
For this reason, I want you to win this round no matter what.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:11.600
Okay, I will show you that you can rely on me.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.220
<i>No problem!</i>

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:29.520
Ladies and gentlemen, the final match of this Asian tournament is here at last.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:38.240
Who will be the champions of Asia?
The BBA team? Or the Chinese team?

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.710
By the end of today, we will know.

00:08:44.530 --> 00:08:46.650
Alright, I see you're fired up for this.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:50.630
Then let me explain the rules in a jiff before the match.

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:56.160
Until now, each team would send out three contestants, and the first team to win two battles would advance,

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.610
but for the finals, we added a special rule. Each contestant will fight three times.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:05.600
This format will let each Blader bring out their skills to the fullest.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.630
Their technique, endurance,
mental strength will be put to test.

00:09:10.880 --> 00:09:16.480
This will be one hard battle, the kind that is best suited for this final round of the Asian tournament.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.400
Let's introduce the stadium for this first battle.

00:09:22.780 --> 00:09:25.370
It's the Round Table Stadium.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:33.620
The stadium for this fight is based on the table used in Chinese cuisine.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:42.870
The lower stadium may look big and easy to fight in, but keeping your balance on the spinning surface will be tricky.

00:09:42.870 --> 00:09:49.200
On the other hand, the upper stadium won't be spinning, but it's really small and confined.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.720
What kind of battle will be taking place in this stadium?

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:54.740
To fight in this stadium will be...

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:57.700
From the BBA team, Max!

00:09:57.840 --> 00:10:00.400
And from the Chinese team, Gaou!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:06.120
Oh yeah...

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:12.260
After I win this, I can eat  meat buns to my heart's content. This is our deal, right?

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:16.770
That's right. So focus on the fight, okay?

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.760
Understood.

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:22.460
Tsk! Thoughtless fool.

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.810
If it was me, I would have put on my game face on to scare off my opponents...

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:27.900
Kiki!

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:30.330
Shut up and watch.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.570
You gotta win no matter what!

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:42.580
<i>Okay!</i>

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:47.700
Alright. Contestants, <i>are you ready?</i>

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:52.080
Draciel, go do your thing.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:54.130
Okay, let's go.

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:54.590
Three, Two, One!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.970
We're counting on you, Max.

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.390
Three, Two, One!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.250
Go... Shoot!

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:06.880
Wow, Draciel and Galzly are clashing violently in the narrow upper stadium!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.440
A close-quarter fight has begun!

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:16.070
I want to eat some meat buns
already. Let's end this quickly!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.910
As expected, tremendous <i>power</i>.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:28.820
That offensive power is three
times that of the Tiger Claw.

00:11:29.720 --> 00:11:34.640
But the new Draciel is holding on well. It's got some amazing defense.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:38.440
But a battle of stamina could be dangerous.

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:42.800
Draciel won't be able to keep enduring those attacks forever!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:50.540
There is <i>one</i> way Draciel can move to the offensive.

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.560
I'm sure Max will realize it soon.

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:40.830
This could be bad.

00:12:43.440 --> 00:12:45.250
I just got a great idea.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:49.580
Draciel!

00:12:56.500 --> 00:13:02.460
Oh! After finding its balance, Draciel started moving! Is it running away from Galzly's attack?

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:03.970
So you noticed.

00:13:04.290 --> 00:13:07.440
I see! I just got it! Of course he could do <i>that</i>!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:09.730
He could do <i>what</i>? I don't get it.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:20.640
<i>Okay, </i>Draciel. You can really keep your balance.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:22.660
You're not getting away!

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:31.620
What's wrong, Galzly? You're wavering big time there.

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:33.920
G-Galzly!

00:13:34.160 --> 00:13:37.930
What makes Galzly special is its great offensive power.

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:43.640
And to bring that power to this level, it must be sacrificing its stability.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:54.440
In short, by going down to the lower stadium where it's hard to keep your balance, he put himself at a disadvantage.

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:59.170
On the other hand, Draciel is great at keeping its stability.

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:04.440
Even in a place like that... No, for this exact reason, Draciel can bring out his full potential.

00:14:05.230 --> 00:14:08.450
I see... Alright! Keep pushing forward, Max!

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:11.810
It's about time to <i>finish</i> this.

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:13.810
<i>Go</i>, Draciel!

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:35.140
<i>Yes!</i>

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:41.150
Wow, what a comeback! The first set goes to Max!

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:44.120
I guess our opponents aren't that stupid.

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:47.900
Why are you so relaxed? You shouldn't have sent that idiot Gaou!

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:52.730
It's nothing to be concerned about. This is their last struggle.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.300
Also, look at him.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.580
Alright!

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:11.360
It's been a long time since
I last fought like this. This will fun.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.340
Gaou... smiled?!

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:20.060
He lost, yet he's smiling..?!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:29.950
The face he's making means he found something more fun than eating. In other words, he's about to go all out.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:35.330
When Gaou smiles, the Bey Stadium gets covered with the corpses of the Beyblades he defeated.

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.830
Okay, here comes the second set!

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:46.800
Well, I'm going. I'll use the same strategy as before.

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:48.750
Yeah, do your best.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:49.810
Max.

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:53.810
Don't let your guard down. Something's different with Gaou.

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.460
Leave it to me!

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.560
That's the spirit! Go beat him!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:00.560
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:08.360
Three, Two, One!

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.830
Go... Shoot!

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:27.760
Holy cow! Galzly's attacks are breaking apart the stadium itself!

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:33.400
I have to flee. Run, Draciel!

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:36.980
You can't run anymore!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.160
This was fun.

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:57.740
The winner of the second set is Gaou.

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:03.360
I can't believe my eyes! I had no idea that he was hiding all that power.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:05.710
That was Gaou's true power.

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:11.220
That power goes way beyond my previous ananysis! Look at this.

00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:19.480
Wow! The Shooter is emitting smoke and flames!

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.960
This is Gaou at full power.

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:25.480
We desperately need a new strategy!

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:38.610
Say, can't we make use of the cracks in the stadium?

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:46.130
I see. If you land on the wrong spot, just keeping your balance will be tough. Maybe he won't be able to attack.

00:17:46.800 --> 00:17:50.340
When it comes to stability and stamina, my Draciel is second to none.

00:17:50.550 --> 00:17:53.330
We don't have much choice. Let's give this plan a try.

00:17:54.580 --> 00:17:58.050
I wonder... Will everything go as planned?

00:17:58.460 --> 00:17:59.280
What?!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.280
Anyway, I'll be going now.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:07.830
It's the start of the third set! Let's see who will prevail!

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:09.930
This set is already ours.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:12.580
Eh? But they seem to have come up with something too.

00:18:12.940 --> 00:18:13.910
It's useless.

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:16.530
No matter what they try.

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:24.210
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:27.760
<i>Come on, </i>Galzly.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:32.880
Three, Two, One!

00:18:33.520 --> 00:18:35.300
Go... Shoot!

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:44.110
<i>Come on, </i>Galzly.

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:49.520
Yeah!

00:18:51.220 --> 00:18:52.230
Charge!

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:53.440
<i>What?!</i>

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.130
Call it.

00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:31.100
T-The winner is Gaou.

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:38.080
With this, the Chinese team wins the first round at 2 to 1!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:39.410
Draciel!

00:19:49.520 --> 00:19:50.510
Draciel!

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.030
Thank goodness you're safe.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:56.060
I hadn't gone all out in a long time.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.480
Gaou.

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:01.150
You put up quite a fight.

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.340
<i>Yes.</i>

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:17.740
This was the one battle I didn't want to lose.

00:20:17.740 --> 00:20:19.700
There's no going back now.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:24.710
That's even better! This kind of situation gets your fighting spirit excited.

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:28.160
But Rei is going to fight the second battle.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:34.960
To be honest, I am worried about whether he will be able to use Byakko's power against the Byakko Clan.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.850
I-I'm sorry! I just...

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:46.520
It's okay. I understand why you're worried.

00:20:46.520 --> 00:20:49.780
But still, I have no intention of losing.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:00.950
Rei-nii, this time has come at last...

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:04.320
But I will come at you with everything I've got.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:08.190
This is my way to show my respect to you, Rei-nii!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.870 --> 00:23:02.730
According to my analysis, next up is the second round of the finals, Rei vs Mao.

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:08.690
Will Rei be able to fight against Mao's Catty Fangs?

00:23:08.690 --> 00:23:14.580
And if this wasn't enough, while fighting against Rei, Mao starts revealing some shocking truths!

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:18.500
I say, what the heck are you doing?!

00:23:18.960 --> 00:23:21.300
Next time: Byakko vs Mountain Cat.

00:23:21.480 --> 00:23:24.020
Rei, this is the springtime of life, is it not?
